  "description": "<p>Bring the wild outdoors into your home with this high-quality area rug. Featuring a detailed Bigfoot or Sasquatch design, this rug is perfect for adding personality and a touch of adventure to your space. It adds rustic charm to any room, ideal for those who appreciate the beauty of the forest and wildlife.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a unique Bigfoot or Sasquatch design.</li>\n<li>Offers durability and comfort with premium materials.</li>\n<li>Non-slip backing ensures safety.</li>\n<li>Soft surface provides a cozy feel underfoot.</li>\n<li>Designed for low maintenance and easy cleaning.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Living Room, Bedroom, Cabin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Not Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Outdoor Adventure, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Product Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Regular vacuuming or gentle washing</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This area rug is suitable for various indoor spaces, including living rooms, bedrooms, and cabins. Its unique design makes it an ideal addition for nature lovers and those looking to enhance their home decor with a rustic, adventurous theme.</p>",
